## Two things worth your attention beyond the findings

**Structural root cause:** `mercans_pipeline_v2_9.sh` contains no C-check that validates `scope_manifest.json` against any artifact. That is why this is the only BE deliverable with no `.bak` and no rectification round — nothing was ever pointed at it. It's simultaneously the best-designed file in the set: its `scope_decisions` control-B7 block doesn't exist in `shared/scope_manifest_template.json` and should be promoted there.

**A self-correction the auditor flagged:** its first docx extractor deduplicated merged cells and made `325.10` appear absent from the CCG when it's present five times. Caught before a finding was written; the dump was rebuilt and every crosswalk re-run. No verdict changed, but it would have produced a false finding against a correct artifact.

